                "text": "CAUTION: The Louisiana Department of Health has issued a \u2018DO NOT USE water advisory\u2019 for all Madison Parish residents who are served by the Walnut Bayou Water System.\n\nThere will be members of my team and local officials at the Walnut Bayou Water Association Office at 1105 Highway 602, Tallulah handing out water provided by LDH starting at 10:30am today. You can also call the Madison Parish Sheriff\u2019s Office at 318-574-1833 to request water delivery.\n\nDo not use or drink tap water until you receive an all clear notice.\n\nhttps://t.co/J4NTpr6Nbu",
