                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019m grateful to the @bonehealthBHOF for the recognition of the Congressional Bone Health and Osteoporosis Champion Award!\n\nI\u2019ve worked to raise awareness and support for osteoporosis research and care\u2014especially through H. Res 806, which calls for more focus on prevention, education, and follow-up care after fractures.\n\nThis award is a testament to the collective efforts of so many who are working to improve care, raise awareness, and ensure that bone health receives the attention it deserves.",
