                "text": "Loved being at @WomansHospital in Baton Rouge this morning to see their innovative work to improve maternal mental health! A pioneer in the industry, this facility has one of the four dedicated maternal mental health units in the entire country.\n\nWoman\u2019s Hospital has also embraced the distribution of Newborn Supply Kits, which my NEST Act would expand in order to better support mothers and their newborns.",
